  m_Text: "OBSIDIAN PROTOCOL\n\nAUTONOMOUS WARFARE\n\n\nDEVELOPMENT\n\nJASON FETTERMAN\nLead Developer\n\n\nGAME DESIGN\n\nJASON FETTERMAN\nGame Director\nSystems Designer\nGameplay Designer\n\n\nPROGRAMMING\n\nJASON FETTERMAN\nLead Programmer\n\nCore Architecture\nGame Systems\nPersistence Systems\nScene Management\nCombat Systems\nCommand Systems\n\n\nAI & AUTONOMY\n\nAUTONOMOUS WARFARE SYSTEMS\n\nAI Command\nUnit Autonomy\nSquad Decision Making\nSensor Processing\nCommand & Intent\nBattlefield Decision Systems\n\n\nWORLD & BATTLEFIELD\n\nWorld Simulation\nTerrain Systems\nBattlefield Systems\nEnvironmental Systems\nStrategic World Systems\n\n\nMILITARY SYSTEMS\n\nFleet Management\nLogistics\nDeployment\nMilitary Budget\nOperations\nIntelligence\nResearch\nTechnology\nResource Management\n\n\nGAMEPLAY\n\nGround Warfare\nAir Warfare\nNaval Warfare\nCommand Units\nSquads\nVehicles\nWeapons\nDestruction\nRecovery\n\n\nUI / UX\n\nCommand Center\nOperations\nGarage\nResearch\nLogistics\nIntelligence\nDeployment\nBattlefield Interface\nUniversal HUD\n\n\nAUDIO\n\nMusic\nSound Design\nCombat Audio\nInterface Audio\n\n\nNARRATIVE\n\nObsidian Protocol\nAutonomous Warfare\nWorld & Faction Lore\nMilitary Operations\n\n\nTECHNOLOGY\n\nUnity\nC# Systems\nSimulation Technology\nArtificial Intelligence\nPersistent World Systems\n\n\nSPECIAL THANKS\n\nEveryone who contributed feedback,\ntesting, ideas, and support.\n\n\nOBSIDIAN PROTOCOL\n\nAUTONOMOUS WARFARE\n\n\nTHE WAR DOES NOT WAIT.\n\nCOMMAND IT.\n\n\n\xA9 2026"
